{"seq":1,"mint":"C11","verb":"claim","status":"ok","model":"openai/gpt-5.6-luna","approach":"split","literals":false,"findings":[{"kind":"contradicts","clause":"therefore ships into `<memo>.tetel/` with every render","clause_quoted":true,"facts":["F9","F22"],"quoted_from":"output","evidence":"/// Copy `workspace_dir`'s shipped files into `<memo>.tetel/`.\n///\n/// Existing files are overwritten: re-rendering a memo replaces its\n/// snapshot, since the snapshot's whole purpose is to match the memo\n/// currently on disk. A file absent from the workspace is skipped rather\n/// than erroring — a workspace with no refusals has no refusals log.","why":"A render skips an absent `refusals.log`, so it does not ship that file with every render.","quoted":true}],"at":1790111859,"cost":0.00933352,"elapsed_ms":69880,"attempts":3,"not_verbatim":0,"literals_refuted":0,"not_a_quantity":0,"kind_off_verb":0,"refuted":0}
